<%# ①开窗观察（§三③ + R1）：排序=金字塔综合分降序（同分贴0轴优先）；top10 展示，其余折叠；计数条锚点 ww-t1 %>
<section id="ww-t1" class="hl-card scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="px-5 py-4 border-b border-line">
    <h2 class="text-hl-16 font-semibold text-ink">① 开窗观察
      <span class="text-hl-13 text-muted-3 font-normal ml-1"><%= ww_block_summary(rows) %></span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-hl-12 text-muted mt-1.5"><%= WindowWatchHelper::TIER_SUBTITLES["T1"] %></p>
  </div>
  <% if rows.empty? %>
    <p class="px-5 py-6 text-hl-13 text-muted-3">本月开窗观察暂无股票</p>
  <% else %>
    <%= render "column_header" %>
    <div class="divide-y divide-line" data-controller="ww-row-link">
      <% rows.first(WindowWatchHelper::TOP_DISPLAY).each do |row| %><%= render "stock_row", row: row %><% end %>
    </div>
    <% if rows.size > WindowWatchHelper::TOP_DISPLAY %>
      <details class="border-t border-line">
        <summary class="px-5 py-2.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none text-hl-12 text-muted hover:text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">展开其余 <%= rows.size - WindowWatchHelper::TOP_DISPLAY %> 只</summary>
        <div class="divide-y divide-line border-t border-line" data-controller="ww-row-link">
          <% rows.drop(WindowWatchHelper::TOP_DISPLAY).each do |row| %><%= render "stock_row", row: row %><% end %>
        </div>
      </details>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</section>
